pi1s4-close-residual-hostile-review-sol56-20260831.md:80:   `C'^2-2 delta_aff=3d-2-M_inf` (D 281-301; C 300-306).  For a nodal affine curve `r=delta_aff`, so Nori's strict inequality is exactly the integral bound `M_inf<=3d-3`.  I independently streamed and hashed Nori's official PDF; Proposition 3.27 says the relevant kernel is finitely generated abelian, which is enough here.
