   242	the independent status of the CLOSE-RESIDUAL low-degree proof itself; this
   243	review confirms the coordinate-invariance repair, not every proof step inside
   244	that lane.
   245	
   246	## Verdict And Recommendation
   247	
   248	Overall verdict: **PROMOTE-AS-CORRECTED / PROMOTE AT TYPED SCOPE.**
   249	
   250	Promote these statements:
