+| `c` | `beta_1` | `delta_inf` | `delta_aff` | `M_inf` |
+|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| 23 | 9  | 4  | 17 | 10 |
+| 21 | 11 | 5  | 16 | 12 |
+| 19 | 13 | 6  | 15 | 14 |
+| 17 | 15 | 7  | 14 | 16 |
