+```text
+Delta=(9,6,c),
+c in {17,16,14,13,11,10,8,7,5,4,2},
+beta_1=27-c.
+```
+
+These are exactly `c<18`, `3` not dividing `c`, and `c in <3,2>`.  The
+cluster is `M(3,beta_1)`: it is `(3^k,1^3)` for `beta_1=3k+1` and
