+
+| `c` | `beta_1` | `delta_inf` | `delta_aff` | `M_inf` |
+|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| 17 | 10 | 9  | 19 | 12 |
+| 16 | 11 | 10 | 18 | 13 |
+| 14 | 13 | 12 | 16 | 15 |
+| 13 | 14 | 13 | 15 | 16 |
+| 11 | 16 | 15 | 13 | 18 |
+| 10 | 17 | 16 | 12 | 19 |
